    "northStar": "Native feature motion",
    "overview": "A reading-focused Astro site explains native GPUI feedback with an illustrated GIF and three original SVG feature sequences. All surface neutrals are achromatic; amber identifies annotations. The illustrations are explanatory, not a running native app.",
